      <div class="progress-track mt-3"><div class="progress-value" style="width: 58%"></div></div>
      <p class="muted mt-2">58% complete</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="lms-section">
  <h2>Verification Notes</h2>
  <article class="lms-card">
    <p class="mb-0">
      Certificate verification endpoints and blockchain/notary integrations can be attached in a later phase.
      Current LMS state focuses on learner progress and downloadable proof files.
    </p>
  </article>
</section>

